translated_text:
Article 17

(1) Prevention of acts of violence against women and children as referred to in Article 16, is carried out by SKPD whose duties and functions are in the field of:

Regional Regulation of HSU Regency Year 2016 Number 3 concerning Protection of Women and Children

a. social;

b. health;

c. education;

d. manpower;

e. women's empowerment and child protection;

f. mental and spiritual; and

g. tranquility and order.

(2) Prevention of acts of violence by SKPD as referred to in paragraph (1), is carried out in an integrated and continuous manner based on the Regional Action Plan.

